Subject: [PATCH] media: claimed capture devices open and deliver frames

Cameras and microphones the profile claims are real capture devices, so
getUserMedia opens them and a page never gets NotReadableError for a
device it enumerated. Enumeration and capture read the same device list.
A claimed camera delivers a dim, low-contrast frame with faint grain and
slow drift, like a sensor facing a plain wall. A claimed microphone
delivers a quiet room-tone hiss at 48 kHz mono, with none of the green
test pattern or periodic beep of Chromium's fake devices.

