+  // A machine with a microphone also enumerates a virtual default entry
+  // pointing at it; a machine with none enumerates nothing at all. If the host
+  // is the second kind and the profile claims the first, the default entry has
+  // to come too, or the claimed machine is one whose microphone the operating
+  // system does not consider a recording device.
+  const bool host_had_devices = !descriptions->empty();
